{
  "id": 1569,
  "title": "What to do on weekend",
  "russian_title": "Что дела́ть на вы́ходные",
  "level": "Beginner",
  "torfl_level": "A2",
  "hsk_tags": [
    "A2"
  ],
  "slug": "what-to-do-on-weekend",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/1569_what-to-do-on-weekend.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "The weekend is here again. A friend asked me what I was going to do, and I said I didn't know. Traveling is out—there are only two days, and that's too short. Playing ball or going for a run is out too; it's too hot. I could study a language, but I study Chinese five days a week, and I don't want to study on the weekend. Mom wants to go shopping, but I don't want to buy anything, and I don't like going to stores. What should I do? I might as well stay home and sleep!"
  ],
  "english_full": "The weekend is here again. A friend asked me what I was going to do, and I said I didn't know. Traveling is out—there are only two days, and that's too short. Playing ball or going for a run is out too; it's too hot. I could study a language, but I study Chinese five days a week, and I don't want to study on the weekend. Mom wants to go shopping, but I don't want to buy anything, and I don't like going to stores. What should I do? I might as well stay home and sleep!",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Выходны́е опять здесь. Друг спра́шивал меня, что я собира́юсь делaть, и я ска́зал, что не зна́ю. Путеше́ствие не подхо́дит—име́ются только два дня, и это сли́шком коро́тко. Игра́ть в мяч или бегать тоже не подхо́дит, потому́ что жа́рко. Я мог бы изуча́ть язы́к, но я изуча́ю кита́йский пять дней в неде́лю, и не хочу́ учи́ть на вы́ходные. Мама хочет ходи́ть на поку́пки, но я не хочу́ что́-нибудь покупа́ть, и мне не нра́вится ходи́ть в магази́ны. Что мне де́лать? Я мог бы остаться до́ма и спать!"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Vykhodnýe obyat' zdes'. Drug spráshival menya, chto ya sobiráyus' delát', i ya skázal, chto ne znáyu. Puteshestvíe ne podkhódit—iméyutsya tol'ko dva dnya, i eto sliškom korotko. Igrat' v myach ili begat' tozhe ne podkhódit, potomú chto zhaŕko. Ya mog by izucháty yazyk, no ya izuchá́yu kitáyskiy pyat' dney v nedélyu, i ne khochú uchíty na vykhodnye. Mama khochet khodít' na pokúpki, no ya ne khochú šta-nibud' pokupáty, i mne ne nravít'sya khodít' v magazíny. Chto mne delát'? Ya mog by ostátsya domá i spat'!"
  ],
