      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "Выходны́е опять здесь.",
      "text_en": "The weekend is here again.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Vykhodnýe\" data-defn=\"выходные\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Выходны́е</span><rt>Vykhodnýe</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"opyat&#x27;\" data-defn=\"опять\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">опять</span><rt>opyat&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zdes&#x27;\" data-defn=\"здесь\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">здесь</span><rt>zdes&#x27;</rt></ruby>.",
